

>> usedMemory1 := 0.
>> usedMemory2 := 0.
>> usedMemory3 := 0.
>> usedMemory4 := 0.

Prograam faraay: 0.

Lim bu: ['addNum:'] def: { :x
	man yokk: x.
}.

Lim bu: ['subtractNum:'] def: { :x
	man wàññi: x.
}.

Lim bu: ['multiplyBy:'] def: { :x
	man leggi-ci: x.
}.

Lim bu: ['divideBy:'] def: { :x
	man xaajal-ci: x.
}.


>> a := 1.
a := a + 1.
a addNum: 3.         
a := a - 1.       
a subtractNum: -0.5. 
a := a × 2.       
a divideBy: 3.    
a := a ÷ 0.1.     
a := a - -1.      
a multiplyBy: 0.5.
a := a + (2 doole: 8).  
a := a + (2 doole: -1). 
a := a + (49 ñeent-reenu).   
a addNum: ((Jokkalante ← 0 ; 1) mag).          
a addNum: ((Jokkalante ← 2 ; 3) ndaw).
Génn bind: a.

Prograam faaral-njaboot.

usedMemory1 := (Prograam xalaat ? 0).


a := 1.
